    <briefdescription>
<para>Data Dependency Graph <ref refid="class_edge" kindref="compound">Edge</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An edge in the DDG can represent a def-use relationship or a memory dependence based on the result of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_dependence_analysis" kindref="compound">DependenceAnalysis</ref>. A rooted edge connects the root node to one of the components of the graph. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
